   294	#### Trace Generation
   295	
   296	Originally, the traces present in `examples-results/ping_pong_example/info.json` were randomly generated.
   297	To recreate the same traces run the following commands:
   298	
   299	```bash
   300	# generate model for ping pong example (-> example_ping_pong.dot)
   301	python run_pmsat_on_example.py ping_pong
   302	
   303	# generate traces with glitches from model
   304	python run_pmsat_on_moore.py example_ping_pong.dot -generation_method lstar -steps 500 -walk_len 5 -glitch_percent 0.01 -seed 65 --only_generate
   305	
   306	# mine models from newly generated ping pong example traces
   307	python run_pmsat_on_traces.py MOORE-results/92e710ef352c4739cd7569794272588a/info.json -nmax 7
   308	```
   309	
   310	> Note: Observe that the newly generated traces have the same hash (and will be saved to the same location) as the traces in `examples-results/ping_pong_example/info.json`
